# 🤖 AI Assistant Builder

A premium AI-powered web application that helps users design, configure, and prototype their own production-ready AI assistants through an intuitive guided workflow.

Built as **Day 40** of the **ABTalks 60-Day Coding Challenge**.

---

## 🚀 Overview

AI Assistant Builder enables users to transform an assistant idea into a structured AI product by defining:

* Assistant domain
* Target audience
* User inputs
* Output format
* Personality & tone

The application automatically generates a production-quality system prompt while providing a premium interactive interface for testing and refining the assistant.

